OL,3,ABarclays cutting 5,000 jobs as it
OL,4,Aincreases reliance on AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarclays is cutting around 5,000 staff
OL,7,Fas it introduces more artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence (AI) into its processes.
OL,10,FThe banking group said 1,000 posts had
OL,11,Falready been closed and it expects a
OL,12,Ffurther reduction of 4,000 to be
OL,13,Fcomplete by the end of this year.
OL,15,FThe cuts amount to 5% of its global
OL,16,Fworkforce with most of them among
OL,17,Foperational and functional roles.
OL,19,FBarclays said the cuts were the result
OL,20,Fof investments in technology, with AI
OL,21,Fmaking some work processes more
OL,22,Fefficient.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
